    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496390/extras/ea3d2bb215a5d644d792e550c0d7d019.avif?t=1739897017\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Boy woke up alone in a mysterious forest. Confused he tries to figure out where he is and how he got here. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496390/extras/afc6701f696e07cb92785e4328c5f8e0.avif?t=1739897017\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496390/extras/cd07b1e072135c1bd535a7916047225b.avif?t=1739897017\" /></span><strong>The Dreamlurker is a dark puzzle-adventure game.</strong> The Boy woke up alone in a mysterious forest. Confused he tries to figure out where he is and how he got here. Run, hide, climb, fight. Avoid all the dangers near you and your companions, steer clear of obstacles and fight your enemies. Do everything in your hand to escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496390/extras/afc6701f696e07cb92785e4328c5f8e0.avif?t=1739897017\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496390/extras/5eea25302f8439428560a1693bca6883.avif?t=1739897017\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 7 unique chapters of Storytelling and Gameplay following the story of <strong>The Boy</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2 Bossfights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2 Endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Platforming mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique puzzles throughout the whole game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496390/extras/afc6701f696e07cb92785e4328c5f8e0.avif?t=1739897017\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496390/extras/de63b6e6763a6145487b6e9844218f0b.avif?t=1739897017\" /></span></p>",
